<title>USA: Hecla Mining approves preferred dividend.</title>
<headline>Hecla Mining approves preferred dividend.</headline>
<dateline>COEUR D'ALENE, Idaho 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hecla Mining Co said its board of directors approved a $2 mlilion dividend payment to preferred shareholders.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable April 1 to shareholders of record March 11.</p>
</text>
